lmbench version: @LMBENCH_VERSION@
Source revision: @LMBENCH_SOURCE_REVISION@
System: @CMAKE_SYSTEM_NAME@
Architecture: @CMAKE_SYSTEM_PROCESSOR@
Compiler: @CMAKE_C_COMPILER_ID@ @CMAKE_C_COMPILER_VERSION@
Compiler target: @CMAKE_C_COMPILER_TARGET@
Configuration: $<CONFIG>
Global C flags: @CMAKE_C_FLAGS@
Configuration C flags: @LMBENCH_CONFIG_FLAGS@
Android ABI: @ANDROID_ABI@
Android platform: @ANDROID_PLATFORM@
OHOS platform: @OHOS_PLATFORM@
OHOS SDK version: @SDK_NATIVE_VERSION@
OHOS compatible SDK version: @OHOS_COMPATIBLE_SDK_VERSION@
Optional tools: @LMBENCH_BUILD_OPTIONAL@
RPC enabled: @LMBENCH_ENABLE_RPC@
